{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vice Thief Simulator: 80s Nostalgia throws you into the dazzling streets of the 1980s, where every neon sign hides new opportunities. Your goal is simple \u2014 get rich at any cost. But beware: one wrong move and the police are already on your trail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere and World</strong> The 80s come alive in every corner: neon lights glow on the streets, pop hits blast from speakers, and the city pulses to the rhythm of disco and criminal intrigue. It\u2019s a time of big temptations and even bigger risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lockpicking Mechanics</strong> Breaking in is your main skill. Simple locks open quickly, but valuable targets are always better protected. Upgrading your tools and experience unlocks the path to heavily secured doors and safes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Theft and Contracts</strong> Cars are a prize of their own. Sneak up to your target, break in, and drive off without being noticed. Deliver it to the drop-off point, avoid the cops, and claim your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pawn Shop and Profits</strong> Everything you can carry \u2014 from old watches to rare electronics \u2014 can be turned into cash. The pawn shop will become your most trusted ally on the road to fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police and Distractions</strong> Cops never rest, but you can outsmart them. Trigger a car alarm, knock over a trash bin, or smash a window to lure them away, while you calmly finish the job elsewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chases and Survival</strong> Mistakes happen, and when they do, you run. Weave through narrow alleys, hide in backyards, and vanish before they catch you. Police don\u2019t forgive failures, but you\u2019re not the type to give up, are you?<br><strong></strong> Vice Thief Simulator: 80s Nostalgia is your ticket to a world of risk and thrill, where wit and speed decide everything. Can you build your fortune and stay free in an era filled with neon lights, temptation, and danger?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043030?t=1761812900","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043030/c93ffb4b7b7b97e8e2a00e832015d7a86b1e3fd3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761812900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043030/3352ebcb5cb6f811cc3d130a32a73a381594b9bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761812900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043030/3352ebcb5cb6f811cc3d130a32a73a381594b9bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761812900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vice Thief Simulator: 80s Nostalgia throws you into the dazzling streets of the 1980s, where every neon sign hides new opportunities. Your goal is simple \u2014 get rich at any cost. But beware: one wrong move and the police are already on your trail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere and World</strong> The 80s come alive in every corner: neon lights glow on the streets, pop hits blast from speakers, and the city pulses to the rhythm of disco and criminal intrigue. It\u2019s a time of big temptations and even bigger risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lockpicking Mechanics</strong> Breaking in is your main skill. Simple locks open quickly, but valuable targets are always better protected. Upgrading your tools and experience unlocks the path to heavily secured doors and safes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Theft and Contracts</strong> Cars are a prize of their own. Sneak up to your target, break in, and drive off without being noticed. Deliver it to the drop-off point, avoid the cops, and claim your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pawn Shop and Profits</strong> Everything you can carry \u2014 from old watches to rare electronics \u2014 can be turned into cash. The pawn shop will become your most trusted ally on the road to fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police and Distractions</strong> Cops never rest, but you can outsmart them. Trigger a car alarm, knock over a trash bin, or smash a window to lure them away, while you calmly finish the job elsewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chases and Survival</strong> Mistakes happen, and when they do, you run. Weave through narrow alleys, hide in backyards, and vanish before they catch you. Police don\u2019t forgive failures, but you\u2019re not the type to give up, are you?<br><strong></strong> Vice Thief Simulator: 80s Nostalgia is your ticket to a world of risk and thrill, where wit and speed decide everything. Can you build your fortune and stay free in an era filled with neon lights, temptation, and danger?</p>","developers":["Oddi Tycoon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043030/59977ed8df46e1203993073aac88d8314e850a77/header.jpg?t=1761812900","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4043030/1088157496/ccb570be8a7d0742b0cc35f5d11c669d2d5f5587/1758621428/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759505907","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4043030/1088157496/ccb570be8a7d0742b0cc35f5d11c669d2d5f5587/1758621428/dash_h264.mpd?t=17595059